          "pageInfo": "11-13",
          "abstractText": "Neodiprion fengningensis, a new record in Gansu, has one generation a year in the forest area of Hasi Mountain It overwinters as prepupa beneath duff, emerges in the mid-June of the next year, incubates in the last ten days of June and pupates in mid-August. Larva has 6 instars. The larvae in the 1st to 3rd instars have a small capacity for eating and a low resistance, so it^s optimum to control it in this period.",
