          "doi": "10.1073/pnas.74.2.533",
          "title": "Identification of a protein methyltransferase as the cheR gene product in the bacterial sensing system.",
          "authorString": "Springer WR, Koshland DE.",
          "authorList": {
            "author": [
              {
                "fullName": "Springer WR",
                "lastName": "Springer",
                "firstName": "W R",
